# Email Configuration for Real Email Delivery
EMAIL_SERVICE=gmail
EMAIL_USER=your-email@gmail.com
EMAIL_PASS=your-app-password
EMAIL_FROM=Core5 Academy <noreply@core5academy.com>

# Instructions:
# 1. Replace your-email@gmail.com with your actual Gmail address
# 2. Generate an App Password from Google Account settings:
#    - Go to: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
#    - Select "Mail" app and "Other device"
#    - Copy the 16-character password
# 3. Replace your-app-password with the generated app password
# 4. Save this file and restart the server
